# Reap What You Sow (windurst 29), completion parity: 475's finish while accepted is the Lua's raw player:completeQuest
# (after the gil, the trade, needToZone; then the fame and the Stationery Set; 477 runs the same lines), so a GM's
# Quest[2][29]Prog survives the completion (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it).
# Accepted (GM) beside Mashuu-Ajuu.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=129.6,-5.75,167.5 job=WAR lvl=75
item SobbingFungus
login
quest Windurst.ReapWhatYouSow accepted
charvar Quest[2][29]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # his default 429 (beside him)
finish
trade Mashuu-Ajuu SobbingFungus x1      # accepted: 475
finish                                  # 500 gil; the fungus taken; needToZone; completed; fame 10; the set; Prog kept
